                            <li><b>Pareto Check:</b> Verify if the top 20% of inputs account for most of the total score impact.</li>
                            <li><b>Next Step:</b> Investigate these high-scoring inputs (Critical X's) in your FMEA or Control Plan.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>`;
                    return html;
                }
